<h3>First, how to type a command</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Type <code>/</code> in the prompt to see the commands available to you. Typing more letters filters the list.</li>
    <li>A command is recognized only at the <strong>start of the message</strong>. Whatever follows is passed to it as arguments.</li>
    <li>If you send a command while Claude is responding, it is queued and runs after that turn. A few, such as <code>/tasks</code>, open right away.</li>
</ul>

